@title Cabinet: Rails and ducts has an optional Carries column per duct
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1920x1080
# qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson-t-junctions.novo: Place all result with ducts. The Rails and ducts list has a
# "Carries" box on each duct row (empty = any wire, hover text explains). Typing "signal" sets it; the box
# shows it back after focus leaves. Pictures: the list before, after typing.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-lesson-t-junctions.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
click_text "Rails and ducts"
wait 10
# The window opens docked on the right; its table is wider than the strip, so float it first.
click 1875 72
wait 10
expect "Carries"
shot list-before
check_layout
click 573 321
wait 5
text signal
wait 5
key Tab
wait 10
expect "signal"
shot list-after
check_layout
